01:23:40.120 --> 01:23:44.580
Our lifelong battle is ending at last in the only way it could.

01:23:44.860 --> 01:23:46.380
Holosphere is standing by.

01:23:47.310 --> 01:23:56.980
When the Great Eye opens, the people of Eternia shall see you kneeling to me just before you die.

01:23:57.940 --> 01:23:59.640
I'll never kneel to you!

01:24:00.220 --> 01:24:02.610
Yes, you will! Yes, you will!

01:24:03.440 --> 01:24:08.240
Or I shall wreak unforgettable harm upon you.

01:24:29.210 --> 01:24:29.590
Lubick.

01:24:30.000 --> 01:24:31.940
Let me drive you home so you can get a little rest, huh?

01:24:32.670 --> 01:24:35.310
I was in Korea. I never saw anything like this.

01:24:39.180 --> 01:24:39.720
That's him!

01:24:42.160 --> 01:24:58.610
Come on, we're moving in. I got it.

01:25:00.000 --> 01:25:00.460
How is she?

01:25:00.740 --> 01:25:01.540
The same, Kevin.

01:25:02.160 --> 01:25:02.360
Okay.

01:25:02.620 --> 01:25:03.900
This should give us the tones we need.

01:25:04.430 --> 01:25:04.870
How?

01:25:06.080 --> 01:25:07.020
Just press the keys.

01:25:07.590 --> 01:25:08.010
Keys?

01:25:08.500 --> 01:25:09.360
What keys?

01:25:10.750 --> 01:25:11.630
Oh, no, no, no, no.

01:25:11.710 --> 01:25:11.830
Here.

01:25:12.030 --> 01:25:12.350
Oh!

01:25:17.280 --> 01:25:17.760
