01:25:24.680 --> 01:25:25.120
Wonderful.

01:25:25.820 --> 01:25:29.330
You never told me you had sonic keys in this world.

01:25:29.650 --> 01:25:29.970
I just...

01:25:30.000 --> 01:25:31.120
I just hope it helps, Gwildor.

01:25:31.220 --> 01:25:32.820
Thank you, Kevin. It's okay.

01:25:38.130 --> 01:25:39.630
And it's ready in the pre-tom.

01:25:42.440 --> 01:25:43.560
Please don't leave me.

01:25:46.350 --> 01:25:50.510
I miss you, Julie. I'll never leave you.

01:26:00.640 --> 01:26:23.320
you love you now where is your strength where is it gone and look at your precious sorceress

01:26:23.440 --> 01:26:27.840
an old crone weak withering dying

