Are you ready to kneel now, proud warrior?

01:26:35.290 --> 01:26:37.170
The moon rises to its apex!

01:26:37.490 --> 01:26:41.460
Do you hear?

01:26:45.590 --> 01:26:50.680
Alpha and the Omega, death and rebirth.

01:26:51.720 --> 01:26:59.440
