01:27:13.590 --> 01:27:13.750
Okay.

01:27:14.290 --> 01:27:19.400
Stay here and cover me, spread out, and wait for my signal.

01:27:19.750 --> 01:27:20.050
Yes, sir.

01:27:21.360 --> 01:27:22.440
These guys are mine.

01:27:26.460 --> 01:27:27.460
Bola Vitornia!

01:27:29.240 --> 01:27:29.960
I stand...

01:27:30.250 --> 01:27:39.280
for the great eye of the galaxy, chosen by destiny to receive the powers of Greyskull.

01:27:40.100 --> 01:27:48.200
This inevitable moment will transpire before your eyes, even as He-Man himself bears witness to it.

01:27:48.340 --> 01:27:49.520
We are open.

01:27:50.150 --> 01:27:57.520
How can it all, star of the universe?

01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:40.360
the universe within me i am i am a part of the cosmos identity flows through through me

01:28:41.670 --> 01:28:51.440
and what consequence are you now this planet these people they are nothing to me

01:28:51.440 --> 01:28:59.800
the universe is power you unstoppable power and i am that force

01:29:08.580 --> 01:29:18.340
You are no longer my evil. I am more than man. More than life.

01:29:19.180 --> 01:29:21.000
My God!

01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:03.270
I better set the power. Now here goes.

01:30:47.560 --> 01:30:50.580
Tell me about the loneliness of good, E-man.

01:30:51.710 --> 01:30:54.930
Is it equal to the loneliness of evil?

01:31:23.800 --> 01:31:23.920
Let's go!

01:31:37.130 --> 01:31:38.610
I lied.

01:31:40.100 --> 01:31:42.000
Farewell, E-Man.

01:31:43.400 --> 01:31:44.910
Lock him!

01:31:46.270 --> 01:31:47.630
Get him!

01:31:51.050 --> 01:31:53.250
Cover action. Kevin, watch the rear.

01:31:53.430 --> 01:31:55.570
You! Watch the pole with position.

01:31:55.770 --> 01:31:58.210
Somebody tell me what the hell's going on around here!

01:31:58.390 --> 01:31:59.980
I feel like I'm in the twilight.

01:32:00.000 --> 01:32:00.740
I don't know something.

01:32:01.100 --> 01:32:03.160
Lubick, this is for real, all right?

01:32:03.280 --> 01:32:04.000
Just get out.

01:32:05.930 --> 01:32:08.800
Nobody takes pot shots at Lubick.

01:32:09.830 --> 01:32:11.530
All right, speakers, you want to play games?

01:32:12.190 --> 01:32:12.810
Let's play.

01:32:13.250 --> 01:32:28.800
Kill him, I want him alive!

01:33:49.770 --> 01:33:59.170
the battle station surely you'll leave with skeletors too here war on let's go signal the retreat

01:34:30.000 --> 01:34:33.200
Longer stand between me and my destiny.

01:34:33.500 --> 01:34:34.180
But I will.

01:34:35.190 --> 01:34:37.250
I told you it was always between us.

01:34:37.370 --> 01:34:40.990
Oh, I hate to smash you out of existence.

01:34:41.490 --> 01:34:45.290
