01:34:45.730 --> 01:34:49.940
Yes, let this be our final battle.

01:36:00.380 --> 01:36:00.660
All right.

01:36:38.990 --> 01:36:59.960
Well Lubick look at you. They're really good

01:37:00.000 --> 01:37:03.940
stay here huh what are you kidding what am i gonna go back there for and look what i got here

01:37:03.940 --> 01:37:12.070
i got i got a castle i got a view i got clean air i got a beautiful woman huh some kind of

01:37:12.070 --> 01:37:28.830
retirement huh julie keep this with you and eternia will always be near q

01:37:31.950 --> 01:37:33.330
I guess this is really goodbye, huh?

01:37:35.920 --> 01:37:39.640
You man, you love, man at arms.

01:37:39.860 --> 01:37:41.640
Don't, don't say goodbye.

01:37:44.360 --> 01:37:45.100
Say good journey.

01:37:48.430 --> 01:37:52.170
There's an old attorney saying, live the journey.

01:37:53.010 --> 01:37:55.150
For every destination is but a doorway to another.

01:38:03.450 --> 01:38:17.700
Look out for him now. I will.

01:38:18.440 --> 01:38:19.600
Activate the doorway, Wildor.

01:38:20.540 --> 01:38:24.190
Are you sure you don't want to go back in your planet's history

01:38:24.190 --> 01:38:27.520
