01:40:10.908 --> 01:40:12.908
I really do want to go to the beach with you today.

01:40:13.052 --> 01:40:14.092
Don't go to Kathleen, okay?

01:40:14.556 --> 01:40:16.716
Don't be silly, honey. Stay home and study.

01:40:16.896 --> 01:40:17.936
Mom, Dad, please.

01:40:19.452 --> 01:40:20.692
Don't get on that plane today.

01:40:22.364 --> 01:40:23.564
I have a terrible feeling.

01:40:23.996 --> 01:40:26.196
Julie, your father's an excellent pilot.

01:40:26.336 --> 01:40:27.276
It's a short trip.

01:40:30.570 --> 01:40:32.880
Julie! Julie! Put those keys back.

01:40:33.060 --> 01:40:36.440
I love you. Julie, where are you going? Come back here.

01:40:49.890 --> 01:40:51.310
Don't let your parents get on that plane.

01:40:51.530 --> 01:40:52.650
I already stopped them.

01:40:52.750 --> 01:40:53.050
No.

01:41:01.340 --> 01:41:01.980
We were there.

01:41:08.476 --> 01:41:09.316
It's funny.
